cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Look Closer: Patch-wise Supervision for AI-Generated Image Detection"
abstract: >-
  Research reference implementation of the multi-patch patch-wise supervision
  (PWS) pipeline for AI-generated image detection: a shared backbone classifies
  explicit RGB crops, every crop receives its own classification loss, and crop
  probabilities are averaged only at inference.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
authors:
